abstract: "A CPU-only classical computer vision research framework for blind reconstruction of shuffled, rotated and partially missing digital image and document fragments, with sparse geometric matching, experimental eroded-boundary recovery, a C++20 acceleration core, Python API, and WebAssembly Studio."
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - image reconstruction
  - jigsaw puzzle solver
  - fragment matching
  - document reconstruction
  - WebAssembly
